    "narrative": "The Austin Waves enter today\u2019s slate with a streamlined lineup necessitated by rest days for heavy hitters like **Kyle Tucker**, **Gunnar Henderson**, and **Vladimir Guerrero Jr.**, whose absences leave a void in power production. Given the scarcity of stolen bases in our current 5x5 build, the focus shifts to maximizing efficiency at the top of the order. **Luis Garc\u00eda Jr.** headlines our unit today with a strong 73.66 score; he faces Feltner, whose 4.98 xERA offers a prime opportunity for high-leverage production. **Luis Garc\u00eda Jr.** benefits from both the park factor and a favorable platoon advantage, making him our most reliable asset for today\u2019s points. Joining him is **Drake Baldwin**, who sits at 68.36; his placement in the leadoff spot against Martinez, N provides a significant boost, as his recent output and the matchup against a subpar arm suggest he will be a key driver for our Runs category.\n\nOur most difficult roster decision today centered on **Dominic Smith** at 58.33, who narrowly edged out our other bench options to secure the UTIL slot. While **Dominic Smith** is just shy of the \"Strong\" start threshold, his situational metrics against Martinez, N\u2014specifically the +7% platoon edge\u2014made him the statistically superior choice over our remaining depth. The team is currently monitoring the health of **Luis Robert Jr.**, who remains sidelined on the IL, limiting our ability to chase stolen base upside. We are keeping a close eye on **Sam Antonacci** (52.10); while his matchup against Jones is not ideal given the SP's solid 3.57 xERA, his leadoff placement keeps his floor high enough to warrant the start over other alternatives like **Miguel Vargas** (45.90), whose lower score reflects a difficult clash against the same arm. With no major weather warnings impacting our venues, we are positioned to maintain our daily game cap efficiency, though we remain thin until **Jackson Merrill**, **Andy Pages**, **Jordan Westburg**, and **Jacob Wilson** return to the daily rotation to bolster our core.",
